Problem: Two Sum II - Input Array Is Sorted (LC 167)

Pattern: Two Pointers

Approach:

1. Initialize left = 0 and right = nums.size() - 1.
2. Calculate sum = nums[left] + nums[right].
3. If sum == target, return {left + 1, right + 1}.
4. If sum > target, move right-- because the sum is too big.
5. If sum < target, move left++ because the sum is too small.
6. Continue until the pair is found.
7. Return an empty vector if no pair is found.

Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
